'''Dawn''' (Japanese: '''ヒカリ''' ''Hikari'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Move an Energy from 1 of your Benched Pokémon to your Active Pokémon.
}}

